{
 "cells": [
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "# Bosonic FlatSpace TeXConversion Unit Tests\n\nUnit tests for TeXConversion of Bosonic FlatSpace fields:\n- Free boson (dX, dXt)\n- Plane wave (expX, expXHolo, expXAntiHolo)\n- Profile (ProfileX)",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {},
   "executionSummary": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "Needs[\"StringCode`\"]\nStringCode`InitStringCode[<|\"theory\" -> \"Bosonic\", \"CFT\" -> \"FlatSpace\", \"conventions\"-> \"Bosonic-Xi\", \"bracket\" -> \"Flat\", \"signature\" -> \"Euclidean\"|>]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {},
   "executionSummary": {
    "timing": {
     "startTime": 1770236040040,
     "endTime": 1770236040194
    },
    "executionOrder": 8,
    "success": true
   }
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## Free Boson dX Tests\n\nNote: dX[mu, n, z] has n+1 derivatives (offset by 1 since dX already has one derivative)",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {},
   "executionSummary": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### Test 1: dX with zero additional derivatives\n\ndX[\\[Mu], 0, 0] -> \"\\partial X^{\\mu}\" (one derivative total)",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {},
   "executionSummary": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "test1 = ToTeX[dX[\\[Mu], 0, 0]];\nexpected1 = \"\\\\partial X^{\\\\mu}\";\ntest1Result = test1 === expected1;\nPrint[\"Test 1 (dX[mu,0,0]): \", If[test1Result, \"PASSED\", \"FAILED - got \" <> test1]];\ntest1Result",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
