  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### Test 9: Normal ordered product with dX and ghosts\n\nR[c[0,0], ct[0,0], dX[\\[Rho],0,0], dXt[\\[Sigma],0,0]] from the plan example",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {},
   "executionSummary": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "test9 = ToTeX[R[c[0, 0], ct[0, 0], dX[\\[Rho], 0, 0], dXt[\\[Sigma], 0, 0]]];\n(* Should contain colons, c, bar{c}, partial X^rho, bar{partial} X^sigma *)\ntest9HasColons = StringContainsQ[test9, \":\"];\ntest9HasC = StringContainsQ[test9, \"c\"];\ntest9HasBarC = StringContainsQ[test9, \"\\\\bar{c}\"];\ntest9HasPartialX = StringContainsQ[test9, \"\\\\partial X\"];\ntest9HasBarPartialX = StringContainsQ[test9, \"\\\\bar{\\\\partial} X\"];\ntest9Result = test9HasColons && test9HasC && test9HasBarC && test9HasPartialX && test9HasBarPartialX;\nPrint[\"Test 9 (R[c,ct,dX,dXt]): \", If[test9Result, \"PASSED\", \"FAILED - got \" <> test9]];\ntest9Result",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
