  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### Test 10: Full example from plan\n\nR[ProfileX[h[\\[Mu],\\[Nu]],{\\[Lambda]},0,0],c[0,0],ct[0,0],dX[\\[Rho],0,0],dXt[\\[Sigma],0,0]]",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
